<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Circus Circus cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Circus Circus cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said it downgraded Circus Circus Enterprises Inc to market perform and removed the stock from the recommended list.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Circus Circus lost 1-1/16 to 22-3/16.</p>
</text>
